{title: 162 - Wondrous Love}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #162 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Dm}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 162}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]What wondrous [C/E]love [Gm]is [A]this,
[Gm]O [C]my [Dm/F]soul, O [F]my [Edim]soul?
[A]What [Am]wondrous [B7]love [F/C]is [Gm]this, [Dm/F]O [Edim]my [E7]soul?
[C]What wondrous love [A]is [Am]this
[Bb]That [C/G]caused [A7/G]the [F]Lord of [C/G]bliss
[Dm/A]To bear [F]the [Gm]dreadful [Edim]curse [C/G]for [Dm/F]my [C/E]soul, for [Bm]my [C/E]soul;
[A]To [A7]bear [F/C]the [Dm]dreadful [C/G]curse [F]for [Edim]my [E]soul?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]To God and [C]to the Lamb [Gm]I will [A]sing,
[A]I [Am]will sing; [B7]To [F/C]God [Gm]and [Dm/F]to [Edim]the [E7]Lamb,
[C]I will sing; [F/C]To [C]God and [A]to [Am]the [Dm/A]Lamb
[Bb]Who is [C/G]the great [A7/G]I am, [F]While millions [C/G]join the [Dm/A]theme,
[A]I will [A7]sing, I [F/C]will sing; [Dm]While [Edim]millions [C/G]join [F]the theme, [Edim]I will [E]sing.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Dm]And when from death [C]I'm free, I'll sing [Gm]on, I'll [A]sing on;
[A]And [Am]when from [B7]death [F/C]I'm [Gm]free, [Dm/F]I'll [Edim]sing [E7]on;
[C]And when [F/C]from [C]death [A]I'm [Am]free,
[Bb]I'll sing [C/G]and joyful [A7/G]be, [F]And through eternity
[A]I'll sing [A7]on, I'll [F/C]sing [Dm]on! And [Edim]through eternity, I'll sing [E]on
{end_of_verse}
